SUMMARY:AYPROS Pub Club: The roof at the radical
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\nJoin AYPROS for our Ju
 ly Pub Club at The Roof at The Radical\, one of Asheville’s most memorab
 le rooftop spots in the River Arts District.\n\nSet on top of The Radical 
 Hotel\, The Roof brings together great drinks\, a vibrant atmosphere\, and
  a summer-evening setting that feels made for connecting with fellow young
  professionals. Whether you’re a longtime AYPROS member or attending you
 r first event\, Pub Club is designed to be a relaxed\, welcoming way to sp
 end time with good people in a memorable Asheville setting.\nPub Club is i
 ntentionally casual. Leave your business cards at home\, come as you are\,
  and enjoy an evening of conversation\, camaraderie\, and community withou
 t any pressure or agenda.\n\nThe evening begins at 5:00 PM. Check in\, gra
 b your first drink\, and settle in for a summer night with familiar faces 
 and new ones. This is a come-and-go event\, so arrive when you can and sta
 y as long as you’d like.\n\nYour first drink is included thanks to our P
 ub Club Title Sponsor\, **Allen Stahl + Kilbourne (ASK Law)**. Additional 
 beverages and food will be available for purchase throughout the evening.\
 nWhether you’re joining us for the rooftop atmosphere\, a post-work drin
 k\, or simply a relaxed evening with other young professionals\, we think 
 this will be a perfect July Pub Club.\n\n**What to Expect**\n\n* A relaxed
 \, come-and-go social atmosphere\n* First drink included courtesy of ASK L
 aw\n* Additional beverages and food available for purchase\n* A lively sum
 mer evening in the River Arts District\n* A welcoming environment for both
  new and longtime AYPROS members\n* No formal program\, no speeches\, and 
 no pressure\n\n**Schedule**\n5:00 PM — Check-in opens\, drinks\, and soc
 ial time\n8:00 PM — Event concludes\n\n**Location**\nThe Roof\nThe Radic
 al Hotel\n95 Roberts Street\nAsheville\, NC 28801\n\n**Parking**\nStreet p
 arking and nearby public parking options are available throughout the Rive
 r Arts District. Please give yourself a few extra minutes to park and make
  your way inside.\nNo formal program. No speeches. No pressure. Just a bea
 utiful Asheville setting\, great conversation\, and an evening spent with 
 Asheville’s young professional community.\n\nA special thank you to Gold
 en Hour for welcoming AYPROS\, and to Allen Stahl + Kilbourne (ASK Law) fo
 r making Pub Club possible by sponsoring everyone’s first drink.\nWe can
 ’t wait to see you there.
